  "body": "Positioned on a peaceful, family-friendly street and privately tucked away from the road, this beautifully elevated three-level home delivers elevated family living, striking harbour views and solid, enduring construction.\r\n\r\nCapturing sweeping views across the Hauraki Harbour and enjoying all-day north-facing sun, this substantial four-bedroom residence has been thoughtfully designed with growing families in mind. Generous proportions, flexible living spaces and excellent separation across three levels provide room for everyone, while the home's robust construction offers confidence for years to come.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, where large windows frame the spectacular harbour outlook and sliding doors open seamlessly onto an expansive floating deck. Whether entertaining friends, hosting family gatherings or simply enjoying your morning coffee in the sun, this is a space that truly makes the most of its elevated position.\r\n\r\nWith four generous bedrooms, three bathrooms, multiple living areas, a versatile top-floor retreat and an oversized double internal-access garage, the home combines functionality, privacy and lifestyle in equal measure.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by established gardens and mature hedging, the property feels wonderfully private while remaining just moments from Eastridge, Mission Bay, the beach, cafe's, restaurants, public transport and sought-after schooling.\r\n\r\nElevated family living, striking harbour views and solid construction come together in a home that offers a rare combination of space, privacy and bays lifestyle.",
